{"entries":[{"id":"tsk-sng-6-1","title":"Song of Solomon 6:1","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"SNG","chapterStart":6,"verseStart":1,"chapterEnd":6,"verseEnd":1},"content":"<p>1 The church professes her faith in Christ. 4 Christ shews the graces of the church; 10 and his love towards her.</p>\n<p>O thou. 4,9,10; 1:8; 2:2; 5:9 that 1:4; Ru 1:16,17; 2:12; Isa 2:5; Jer 14:8; Zec 8:21-23; Ac 5:11-14</p>"},{"id":"tsk-sng-6-2","title":"Song of Solomon 6:2","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"SNG","chapterStart":6,"verseStart":2,"chapterEnd":6,"verseEnd":2},"content":"<p>gone. 11; 4:12-16; 5:1; Isa 58:11; 61:11; Mt 18:20; 28:20 the beds. 5:13 feed. 1:7,8; Isa 40:11; Eze 34:23; Zep 3:17; Joh 4:34,35; Re 7:17 and to. 2:2; Isa 57:1; Joh 14:3; 17:24; Php 1:21-23; 1Th 4:13,14</p>"},{"id":"tsk-sng-6-3","title":"Song of Solomon 6:3","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"SNG","chapterStart":6,"verseStart":3,"chapterEnd":6,"verseEnd":3},"content":"<p>my beloved's. 2:16; 7:10; Heb 8:10; Re 21:2-4 he. 2:16</p>"},{"id":"tsk-sng-6-4","title":"Song of Solomon 6:4","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"SNG","chapterStart":6,"verseStart":4,"chapterEnd":6,"verseEnd":4},"content":"<p>beautiful. 10; 2:14; 4:7; 5:2; Eze 16:13,14; Eph 5:27 as Tirzah. 1Ki 14:17; 15:21,33 comely. Ps 48:2; La 2:15; Re 21:2 terrible. 10; Nu 24:5-9; Ps 144:4-8; Zec 12:3; 2Co 10:4; Re 19:14-16</p>"},{"id":"tsk-sng-6-5","title":"Song of Solomon 6:5","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"SNG","chapterStart":6,"verseStart":5,"chapterEnd":6,"verseEnd":5},"content":"<p>away. Ge 32:26-28; Ex 32:10; Jer 15:1; Mt 15:27,28 overcome me. or, puffed me up. 4:1-3</p>"},{"id":"tsk-sng-6-6","title":"Song of Solomon 6:6","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"SNG","chapterStart":6,"verseStart":6,"chapterEnd":6,"verseEnd":6},"content":"<p>4:2; Mt 21:19; 25:30</p>"},{"id":"tsk-sng-6-8","title":"Song of Solomon 6:8","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"SNG","chapterStart":6,"verseStart":8,"chapterEnd":6,"verseEnd":8},"content":"<p>1Ki 11:1; 2Ch 11:21; Ps 45:14; Re 7:9</p>"},{"id":"tsk-sng-6-9","title":"Song of Solomon 6:9","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"SNG","chapterStart":6,"verseStart":9,"chapterEnd":6,"verseEnd":9},"content":"<p>My dove. 2:14; 5:2 one; she. Nu 23:9; Ps 45:9; Ga 4:26; Eph 4:3-6 The daughters. De 4:6,7; 33:29; Ps 126:2; Pr 31:28,29; 2Th 1:10; Re 21:9,10</p>"},{"id":"tsk-sng-6-10","title":"Song of Solomon 6:10","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"SNG","chapterStart":6,"verseStart":10,"chapterEnd":6,"verseEnd":10},"content":"<p>Who. 3:6; 8:5; Isa 63:1; Re 21:10,11 looketh. 2Sa 23:4; Job 11:17; Pr 4:18; Isa 58:8; Ho 6:5; Re 22:16 fair. Job 31:26; Eph 5:27 clear. Ps 14:5; Mal 4:2; Mt 13:43; 17:2; Re 10:1; 12:1; 21:23; 22:5 terrible. 4; Ro 8:37</p>"},{"id":"tsk-sng-6-11","title":"Song of Solomon 6:11","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"SNG","chapterStart":6,"verseStart":11,"chapterEnd":6,"verseEnd":11},"content":"<p>the garden. 2; 4:12-15; 5:1; Ge 2:9; Ps 92:12-15; Joh 15:16 to see the. 7:12; Isa 5:2-4; Mr 11:13; Lu 13:7; Ac 15:36</p>"},{"id":"tsk-sng-6-12","title":"Song of Solomon 6:12","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"SNG","chapterStart":6,"verseStart":12,"chapterEnd":6,"verseEnd":12},"content":"<p>Or ever I was aware. Heb. I knew not. soul. Jer 31:18-20; Ho 11:8,9; Lu 15:20 made me like the chariots of Amminadib. or, set me on thechariots of my willing people.</p>"},{"id":"tsk-sng-6-13","title":"Song of Solomon 6:13","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"SNG","chapterStart":6,"verseStart":13,"chapterEnd":6,"verseEnd":13},"content":"<p>return. 2:14; Jer 3:12-14,22; Ho 14:1-4 What. 1:6; Lu 7:44; 15:10; 2Th 1:10 Shulamite. Ge 49:10; Ps 76:2; Isa 8:6; Joh 9:7; Heb 7:2 As. Joh 10:16; Ro 3:29; Eph 2:14-17 two armies. or, Mahanaim. Ge 32:2; Ro 7:23; Ga 5:17; Eph 6:10-19</p>"}]}